<title>FRANCE: Clarins to issue bonus shares on Sept 26.</title>
<headline>Clarins to issue bonus shares on Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beauty care firm Clarins said a one-for-eight bonus share issue announced at its annual meeting in June would take place on September 26.</p>
<p>The issue will create 1.3 million new shares, raising the total to 11.75 million, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
